# Optional. Wraps the Namecheap registrar link in an affiliate network's
# click-tracking redirect once you have one — Impact, ShareASale, and
# Namecheap's own program all use this "redirect through us, then to this
# target URL" shape. Must contain the literal placeholder {url}, which gets
# replaced with the encoded Namecheap search-results link.
#
# Left unset, the app links straight to Namecheap with no tracking.
#
# Example (Impact Radius shape — replace with your real one):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_NAMECHEAP_AFFILIATE_URL=https://namecheap.pxf.io/c/XXXXXXX/XXXXXXX/XXXX?u={url}
